From ea78949f117b7764a50e30f06cf3b08420f8cc79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vultr MCP <mcp@vultr.local>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 18:02:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add FrankenPHP worker mode + Symfony Console + fix Windows
 STDIN

- Dockerfile: switch to dunglas/frankenphp base with worker mode
- public/index.php: FrankenPHP worker entry (forces HTTP transport)
- bin/console: Symfony Console with mcp:stdio and mcp:generate commands
- Server.php: fix auto-detect when STDIN undefined (Windows php -S),
  make autoload idempotent for worker mode, replace SapiEmitter with
  native PHP response emission (removes laminas dependency)
- composer.json: add symfony/console, symfony/runtime,
  runtime/frankenphp-symfony; remove vlucas/phpdotenv,
  laminas/laminas-httphandlerrunner
- k8s/configmap: remove VULTR_MCP_TRANSPORT (forced by entry point)
- Tested: healthz, MCP initialize, auth rejection, STDIO via bin/console
---
 Dockerfile         | 61 ++++++++++++++++-------------------
 bin/console        | 80 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 composer.json      | 16 ++++++----
 k8s/configmap.yaml |  3 --
 public/index.php   | 25 +++++++++++++++
 src/Server.php     | 38 +++++++++++++++++++---
 6 files changed, 174 insertions(+), 49 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 bin/console
 create mode 100644 public/index.php

